      "writtenOn": "2019-02-04T17:31:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We talked about doing that in the original fernet implementation. IIRC, we didn\u0027t implement caching initially because we wanted new keys to be picked up immediately.\n\nIt\u0027s been a while since that optimization has been discussed. I\u0027ll see if I can come up with a way to do this. Do you mind if I experiment with that in a follow on or do you want it implemented in this patch?",
